---
description: Zero-Regression harness — standing rules
alwaysApply: true
---
- Never edit any file under subjects/*/legacy/ or subjects/*/golden/.
- Never run git push, never change repository visibility, never rewrite git history.
- Pinned environment: Python 3.12.3, mutmut 3.6.0, pytest 9.1.1, pytest-cov 7.1.0. Do not upgrade or substitute.
- Every CONFIG record is written from the lockfile, never typed by hand.
- No client names, no "ADL", no "Agent Factory", no "Deal Desk", no Fly.io names, no secrets in any file or commit message.
- If a step in a work order fails, stop and report. Do not work around it.
- Evidence-log record types: CONFIG, BASELINE, MUTANT_RESULT, TRIAGE, OVERRIDE, CERTIFICATE. Nothing else.
- Roles only (Generator, Adjudicator, Executor) in README and other prose. Evidence-log records (CONFIG, CERTIFICATE) MUST pin concrete tool, model and version identities. Never redact an evidence log.
